rk-bench

The librknnrt ctypes binding (src/rkbench/rknn_runtime.py) and the
PERF_DETAIL parser (src/rkbench/perf_parse.py) are adapted from RK Edge
Doctor (https://github.com/anguoyang/rk-edge-doctor), a project by the
same author, released under the Apache License 2.0. rk-bench adds the
benchmark protocol, the RSS memory probe, the per-frame RW accounting,
and the leaderboard data model on top of that measurement method, so
numbers from both projects are directly comparable.
